description=Telegram bot for rooted Android (ZTE F50). 12-language UI (en/tr full, +es/de/fr/pt/ru/zh/ja/ko/ar/hi seeded). status/AT/shell/ZTE perf/IMEI/SMS/file/screenshot/wifi/ramclean/FS/network/power/app-mgmt/scheduling/heartbeat/quiet-hours/upload/tailscale/speedtest/update + traffic-stats history + AdGuard Home control + /install_module (manifest-driven catalog) + sha256 zip-integrity verify (install AND update). Requires bin-utils v1.3.0+ (curl, jq, bash, lib/common.sh).
